{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"screen\": \"不必解释难过，也不必维持坚强；压着的愿望、委屈和思念浮现，祈求却没有回应\",\n      \"source\": \"歌唱又像向某个遥远、并不确定的对象祈求，愿望真切，音乐却没有许诺回应。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿说的是没有许诺回应，并未确定祈求没有得到回应，屏幕稿把未承诺写成了没有回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"熟悉歌唱与舞曲只剩轻弱碎片，摇篮曲也在F小调破碎重现\",\n      \"source\": \"它们既像先前如歌旋律的碎片，也像那些舞曲主题的残片；另一种更凄厉哀婉的听法，是听见先前那段摇篮曲破碎地重现，只是这次变成了F小调。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确将摇篮曲破碎重现标为另一种听法，屏幕稿却将这一可选解释写成了确定的音乐呈现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"开头试探又问：我究竟要怎样继续生活？\",\n      \"source\": \"如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿用条件和仿佛限定这是一种心理解读，屏幕稿删去限定，将可选解释写成了确定的提问。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"screen\": \"这次挺立是主动选择：会犹疑、疲惫、想念，也不必假装没受过伤\",\n      \"source\": \"这份挺立也可以听成经历动摇后的主动选择：即使知道自己会犹疑、疲惫、想念，仍然可以决定怎样站立。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿只是提供一种可以成立的听法，屏幕稿改成确定判断，把可能的心理解读写成了明确结论。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c233a79c-8198-4563-abca-08d711f4c5ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T032556975408Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T03:27:19.174222+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "457fad3d69011f7f3eb1f251eb44a5138caa702c90b58390912e430982b72b83", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T032556975408Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d60a8a82ae1ad95c438f7e0e5be02976102109f9bd382bfa439a8c910435e654"}}}
